Module: include/Time/ManualClock.h
- Namespace: Time
- class ManualClock : public IClock { public:
  - explicit ManualClock(std::int64_t start_ms);
  - void set_now(std::int64_t ms);
  - void advance(std::int64_t delta_ms);
  - std::int64_t now_ms() const noexcept override;
  private: std::int64_t current_ms_;
}
Contract:
- Header must directly contain #include <cstdint>.
- ManualClock is deterministic and only changes when set_now/advance are called.
- set_now sets the internal current time to ms; advance adds delta_ms (delta may be negative; advancing backwards is allowed for tests).
- now_ms returns current_ms_. noexcept.

